                  "text": "1 Mak 3:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino makani amwi aa-Jehoyakimu, azisesemyo nzyaakacita amilandu iyakajanwa mulinguwe, alilembedwe mubbuku lyabami ba-Israyeli aba-Juda, Elyo Jehoyakini mwanaakwe wakulya izina lyakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
