        {
          "text": "Jehoyakini kajisi myaka iili musanu aitatu naakaba mwami, nkabela wakeendelezya mu-Jerusalemu myezi yotatwe amazuba aali ikumi aane. Nkabela wakacita bubi mumeso aa-Jehova. ",
