                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumwaka mupya Nebukadinezara wakatuma, wamuleta ku-Babuloni, antoomwe azibelesyo ziyandisi zyaŋanda ya-Jehova. Nkabela Zedekiya mupati wakwe wakamulisya bwami bwa-Juda abwa-Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
