                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela wakasisya kulimbabo mwami wabaKasidi, wajazya bakubusi babo ipanga muŋanda yacikombelo cabo. Takwakafwida muntu luzyalo, naba mukubusi naba musimbi, naba mudala naba mucembele. Boonse buyo wakabaaba mumaanza aakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
