                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azyalo zibelesyo zyoonse zyaŋanda ya-Leza, niziba zipati niziba ziniini, azintu ziyandisi zyaŋanda zya-Jehova, azintu ziyandisi zyamwami abapati bakwe, wakazigwisya zyoonse, wazitola ku-Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakatenta iŋanda ya-Leza akumwaya bulambo bwa-Jerusalemu. Amaanda oonse aabwami bakaatentya mulilo, akunyonyoona zibelesyo ziyandisi zyao zyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaabo ipanga mbolyakaleka, wakabatola boonse mubuzike ku-Babuloni. Bakaba bazike bakwe, walo abana bakwe, mane lumwi bwakabuka bwami bwa-Persia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbulyakazuzigwa ijwi lya-Jehova ndyaakaamba kumulomo wa-Jeremiya. Akaba obo mane nyika yakapumuna masabata aayo. Mazuba oonse aakusaalwa, nyika yakalyokezya, mane kusikila myaka iili makumi aali musanu aabili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
